      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>In the name of God, the Merciful, the Compassionate.</li>\n<li>There is a need for a noble decree to be written to the official in charge of the kha[r\u0101j] in Q\u016b\u1e63,</li>\n<li>informing him that the district known as Ibn\u016bd, currently held as an iq\u1e6d\u0101\u02bf, </li>\n<li>belongs to the two [most em]inent and exalted appointees\u2014the noble, the felicitous, the chosen of the caliphal court</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
